@startuml uml_state_issue
!include style.iuml
skinparam nodesep 50
skinparam ranksep 55
title SmartFix: UML State Machine Diagram (Issue lifecycle)

[*] --> Reported : resident submits report\n/ Reports saves issue, publishes IssueReported

state Reported
Reported : entry / Validation classifies photo (FR-2)
Reported --> Reported : IssueNeedsReview\n[confidence low or not infrastructure]\n/ add to operator review list (FR-4)
Reported --> Validated : IssueValidated\n[model confident, or operator approves]\n<<Validation>>
Reported --> Merged : IssueDuplicateDetected\n[open issue of same type within 50 m]\n<<Validation>>
Reported --> Rejected : ReportRejected\n[operator rejects]\n<<Validation>>

Validated --> Prioritized : IssuePrioritized\n/ score = severity + capped duplicate bonus + aging\n<<Priority>>
Prioritized --> Assigned : WorkOrderCreated\n/ crew matched, deadline set (FR-6)\n<<Work Orders>>
Assigned --> InProgress : WorkOrderStatusChanged\n[crew started]\n<<Work Orders>>
InProgress --> Completed : RepairCompleted\n[after photo uploaded]\n<<Work Orders>>

state "In Progress" as InProgress

Completed --> Closed : IssueClosed\n[resident confirms,\nor 7 days with no reply]\n<<Reports>>
Completed --> Reopened : RepairDisputed\n/ reopen_count + 1 (FR-9)\n<<Reports>>
Reopened --> Prioritized : IssuePrioritized\n[higher priority]\n<<Priority>>

Prioritized --> Escalated : DeadlineMissed\n<<Priority>>
Assigned --> Escalated : DeadlineMissed\n<<Priority>>
InProgress --> Escalated : DeadlineMissed\n<<Priority>>
Escalated : entry / is_escalated = true,\ntop of queue, alert supervisor (FR-11)
Escalated --> Assigned : work order reassigned\n<<Work Orders>>
Escalated --> InProgress : WorkOrderStatusChanged\n<<Work Orders>>
Escalated --> Completed : RepairCompleted\n<<Work Orders>>

Closed --> [*]
Merged --> [*]
Rejected --> [*]
Merged : the report now belongs\nto the existing issue

legend right
  <b>Reading the labels</b>
  Event [guard] / action
  <<Module>> = the only module allowed to make
  this transition (status_transitions table, NFR-4)
  Every transition is written to issue_status_history.
  Rejected and Merged are terminal states added in the
  database design so these reports have an end state.
endlegend
@enduml
